## 3. Covered Files / 授权文件

The seven vocabulary files in the `vocabularybook/` directory of the VocaPip
repository, byte-for-byte identical to the files of the same names in
`KyleBing/english-vocabulary` at commit
`66f4a6db7b61eab3534d7b84f10eed312bca4ed6` (master):

