## 5. Conditions / 条件

1. **Attribution / 署名** — any distribution of the files (original or
   modified) must retain this notice and visibly credit
   `KyleBing/english-vocabulary` (https://github.com/KyleBing/english-vocabulary)
   as the source.
   任何对上述文件（原始或修改后）的分发都必须保留本通知，并显著标注来源为
   `KyleBing/english-vocabulary`（https://github.com/KyleBing/english-vocabulary）。
2. **Scope of the grant / 授权范围** — this grant is made to the extent of the
   Grantor's own rights in the files. As documented in the
   `english-vocabulary` README, the files derive from the upstream chain
   [kajweb/dict](https://github.com/kajweb/dict) →
   [KyleBing/dict](https://github.com/KyleBing/dict) →
   `KyleBing/english-vocabulary`. Any rights held by upstream sources remain
   with their respective owners and are neither transferred nor waived by this
   license. The Grantee remains responsible for complying with any applicable
   upstream terms.
   本授权仅在授权方对上述文件享有的权利范围内作出。如 `english-vocabulary`
   的 README 所述，这些文件源自上游衍生链
   [kajweb/dict](https://github.com/kajweb/dict) →
   [KyleBing/dict](https://github.com/KyleBing/dict) →
   `KyleBing/english-vocabulary`。上游来源所持有的任何权利仍归其各自权利人所有，
   本许可既不转移也不放弃这些权利；被授权方仍应自行遵守适用的上游条款。

